  "description": "Electric Mountain Bike - DJ Mountain Bike\nThe DJ Mountain Bike is an Amazon's Choice awarded electric mountain bike that’s built to last with high-quality components and comes equipped with everything you need for a great ride around town or off-road – an integrated front headlight, adjustable front suspension and front and rear mud guards are included. Ride with confidence on all-purpose tires that give the comfortable ride you want in town and the performance you need on the trail.\nThis mountain ebike from DJ Bikes Canada is powered by a 500W 48V motor and features 5 levels of pedal assist that puts the power of the motor right in your pedal stroke, and the easy-to-access thumb throttle provides power on-demand. The long-lasting 48V LG battery can be dismounted and charged anywhere on the go. The charger has a safety design to prevent over-charged.\nThe DJ Mountain Bike is designed in Canada to be affordable, powerful and tons of fun - the best electric mountain bike for hills, trails or the city. Whether you are a commuter, casual rider or sports fan, this electric mountain bike is built for everyone. This is the best value buy in the range of 500W 48V mountain ebikes.",
